  "instructionHtml": "<p>I’m using <code>MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M3-MXFP8</code> behind vLLM’s OpenAI chat completions API. Our incident-response agent exposes an internal MCP runbook search as a function tool, and I sent this request:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki ai-infra-paper\" style=\"background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">model</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M3-MXFP8\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">messages</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">      \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">role</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">      \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">content</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"Checkout API is returning elevated 502s. Search the current incident runbooks for mitigation steps before answering.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#2D6F7A\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">tool_choice</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">tools</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">      \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">type</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">      \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">function</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">        \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">name</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"search_incident_runbooks\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">        \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">parameters</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">          \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">type</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">          \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">properties</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">            \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">service</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">type</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">            \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">symptom</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">type</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">          \"</span><span style=\"color:#6E5C8A\">required</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">:</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\">\"service\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">,</span><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\"> \"symptom\"</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#686D67\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>I notice that the beginning of the stream looks very strange:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki ai-infra-paper\" style=\"background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"reasoning\":null,\"content\":\"&#x3C;mm:think>\"}}]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"reasoning\":null,\"content\":\"I should search the current checkout incident runbook first.\"}}]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"reasoning\":null,\"content\":\"&#x3C;/mm:think>\"}}]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"reasoning\":null,\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"search_incident_runbooks\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"service\\\":\\\"checkout-api\\\",\\\"symptom\\\":\\\"elevated 502s\\\"}\"}}]}}]}</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>The thinking content is showing up in the content field. But when I send the same request with <code>\"stream\":false</code>, the thinking text is in the reasoning field, the <code>&#x3C;mm:think></code> markers are hidden, and the same structured tool call is returned. Why does this happen only in the streaming response? I need streaming to separate reasoning, visible content, and the structured tool call in the same way as the working non-streaming request, without changing that result or the existing tool-call behavior.</p>",
